Counter-stimulus payload for _ctl/tests/fetch-verified.test.sh.

This file stands in for a release asset. The test fetches it over file://,
because a hermetic test cannot reach the network, and hands
_build/fetch-verified.sh the digest below as the pin.

Do not edit this file. Its sha256 is written as a LITERAL in the test, so an
edit here turns every case red at once and the first check names the reason.
